    "summary": {
        "en": [
            "The same numbered grid as the tiled fixture, delivered through a strict IIIF Image API 2.1 service — one that rejects any quality other than `default`, as 2.1 requires. A 2.0 and a 2.1 document are indistinguishable (same @context, same profile URIs), so a renderer that asks a version 2 service for the deprecated `native` quality gets a 4xx for every tile, spends its one retry on each, and paints the canvas permanently blank with nothing on screen to say why. Presentation 3 deliberately, so that the Image API version is the only thing this fixture varies."
        ]
    },
    "items": [
        {
            "id": "/demo-manifests/tiled-v2/canvas/one",
